"""OpenFE RBFE workflow page for ChemFlow Studio — the five-step setup, same as
AlchemForge's OpenFE dialog, driving the ``alchemforge openfe rbfe`` CLI.

Sub-tabs: Ligand Preparation (charge) → Network Creation (planner/mapping) →
System (soluble or membrane; membrane needs a valid PBC box) → FEP simulation
→ Job Setting (HPC) → Execution. The form writes one create_json YAML; Execution
runs validate / setup-FEP (create_json) / local submit through the shared Activity
console, or writes a SLURM submit script with the HPC parameters.
"""

